---
description: Accessibility for visual components, navigation, and forms
globs:
  - "src/components/**/*.astro"
  - "src/pages/**/*.astro"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer semantic elements and native controls.
- Use links for navigation and buttons for actions.
- Preserve keyboard order, visible focus, and accessible names.
- Connect labels, help, errors, and status messages.
- Give informative images contextual alt text and decorative images empty alt.
- Do not rely on color, hover, icon, or motion alone.
- Respect zoom, reduced motion, touch targets, and text expansion.
